  "notes": "Dark IDE-style game data editor (type-pal). Pixel-art character portraits in list and header give game flavor. Section panels use a blue small eyebrow (身份/外观/战斗) above bold title and muted description, divided header/body with hairline separator; key-value rows right-aligned bold values with hairline row dividers. Selected list item uses #2d3852 fill and blue left accent bar. Inspector tabs are a segmented style with outlined filled active tab. Bottom status bar shows diagnostics state (live later showed '⚠ 181 项待处理') and save state. Toolbar tooltips show label · shortcut. Delete button in danger red outline (disabled)."
